{
  "author": "KC桌面",
  "content": "<section style=\"margin:0 0 22px;padding:18px 16px;border-left:5px solid #C9A227;background:#F7F3E8\"><p style=\"margin:0 0 8px;color:#7A5B12;font-size:14px;font-weight:700\">外资精译</p><p style=\"margin:0;color:#142033;font-size:21px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.4\">花旗：工业富联3Q26业绩好于担忧-云业务与800G交换机放量</p></section>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">先看数字。工业富联<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">三季度</span>收入<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">3840亿元</span>，环比增<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">25%</span>、同比增<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">58%</span>，比<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700\">Citi</span>自身预测高<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">4%</span>，比市场一致预期高<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">6%</span>；净利润166亿元，环比增27%、同比增60%。这份Citi研报的判断很直接：在Rubin平台和苹果产品发布节奏都被推迟的背景下，市场此前对三季度的预期偏谨慎，实际结果比“担心的情形”要好。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">更值得拆开看的是收入结构。云业务<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">三季度</span>同比增<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">75%</span>、环比增<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">25%</span>，上半年同比增速是<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">76%</span>，也就是说在更高基数上基本守住了增速。其中GPU AI机柜出货同比增<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">70%</span>、环比增<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">15%</span>，ASIC AI机柜出货同比增约<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">1.5倍</span>、环比增80%。网络设备收入同比增1.2倍，800G以上交换机出货同比增80%、环比增25%。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOUWSvQGav4UJAWqSiaAO9KZSibyDkibXZfL0ABAmMQTDU5SAjcGVlHgXGuHibVDzJOH9zVTvkhv994CcxDsNBLRiaVjEwE9YuqWfOwM/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"研报原图 1\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></p>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOWdVYic0784UtrlS3wJpsDPc5Iiadex0GzurkzlqybViaGowrEj6TAZD1mlmD0FwNIuick3ssef20Ld3xVLzqhaNXcFBt5Tn7xXCFs/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"研报原图 2\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></p>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOU5pdCcBnpZgyYQYggykmBUKWdXOmfuqSxRgxggnZI6JS3RicaMcHUgzAnBGiaBEsPOsy9TGcm01yJjfyaz7kuSo1ic1Sficmodoss/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"研报原图 3\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></p>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">这组数字放在一起，指向一件事：市场担心的是“推迟”，报表反映的是“换挡”。Rubin相关产品节奏后移，但ASIC路线和800G交换机的放量接了上来，把云业务的环比增长撑住了。单看同比增速从<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">76%</span>降到<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">75%</span>几乎无感，拆到季度环比和产品线，才能看到增量来自哪里。</p>\n<section style=\"margin:18px 0;padding:13px 15px;background:#F1F8F4;border-left:4px solid #2F8F5B;color:#223044;font-size:15px;line-height:1.75\"><strong>KC评论：</strong> ASIC机柜环比增<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">80%</span>、GPU机柜环比只增<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">15%</span>，两者差距比同比数字更能说明<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">三季度</span>的边际变化。简单说，通用GPU受平台切换节奏影响更大，定制芯片路线反而在补位；后续更值得看的是四季度ASIC环比能否继续快于GPU，这决定了“推迟”是一次性扰动还是需求结构的位移。</section>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">利润端没有收入那么亮眼。毛利率<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">7.0%</span>，同比环比都持平，但比<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700\">Citi</span>预测低0.3个百分点；营业利润<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">210亿元</span>，同比增<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">63%</span>，却比<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700\">Citi</span>预测低<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">4%</span>；净利润也比<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700\">Citi</span>预测低5%，只是比市场一致预期高8%。收入超预期、利润略低于自身模型，说明增量收入的利润率并不高。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">这并不意外。AI机柜和交换机属于组装、集成交付环节，规模上得快，议价空间却有限。收入<span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700\">超预期</span>、毛利率<span style=\"color:#B26B00;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">低于预期</span>的组合，本质是产品结构继续向低毛利、高周转的AI硬件倾斜。<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700\">Citi</span>因此把<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2026年</span>净利润下调<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">4%</span>至<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">593亿元</span>，<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2027</span>、2028年基本维持在891亿和1147亿元，调整主要落在近端。</p>\n<section style=\"margin:18px 0;padding:13px 15px;background:#F1F8F4;border-left:4px solid #2F8F5B;color:#223044;font-size:15px;line-height:1.75\"><strong>KC评论：</strong> 毛利率连续三个季度停在<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">7.0%</span>，收入却同比增<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">58%</span>，这说明增长几乎完全靠规模而非单价。我的理解是，这类代工集成业务的利润弹性来自产能利用率和费用摊薄，而不是毛利率抬升；接下来更值得观察的是营业利润率能否随收入放大而<span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700\">回升</span>，三季度<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">5.5%</span>的营业利润率比<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700\">Citi</span>预测低了0.5个百分点。</section>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">估值口径的变化比盈利预测更值得<span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">注意</span>。<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2027年</span>预测市盈率从<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">22倍</span>降到<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">15倍</span>。拆开看，非AI部分维持<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">15倍</span>，与苹果供应链平均估值接近；AI部分也从<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">25倍</span>降到<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">15倍</span>，理由是近期AI硬件板块情绪转弱，向同业目标倍数看齐。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\"><span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">换句话说</span>，盈利预测只动了近端<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">4%</span>，估值倍数却调整了约三成。<span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">核心是</span><span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700\">Citi</span>对AI硬件给多少倍PE的假设变了。这个动作本身带有板块beta的属性，不完全是对公司基本面的重新定价。</p>\n<section style=\"margin:28px 0 0;padding-top:12px;border-top:1px solid #D9DEE7;color:#737D8C;font-size:12px;line-height:1.75\"><p style=\"margin:0 0 8px\">——人工智能免责声明（部分内容由人工智能工具辅助生成）</p><p style=\"margin:0\">撰稿：Leo<br>责编：KC<br>排版：胡桃</p></section>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOW5rHGibgKiaveU0R7f39CtWQLoAofdOcIIKXEm99PeYcH7bGzqTAKl4UHbT37Qsuf2RdyJreW0Fl5fpSKQmKw8WNaaj44icubrnU/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"KC桌面\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></p>\n<p style=\"margin:16px 0 0;color:#A3ABB8;font-size:12px;line-height:1.55;text-align:left\">Original report: 34-Foxconn Industrial Internet -601138- 3Q26 Results Better than Feared- Model Update-261029</p>\n<p style=\"margin:16px 0 0;padding:14px 16px;background:#EAF2FB;border-left:4px solid #2E6FB7;color:#152033;font-size:15px;line-height:1.75;font-weight:600\">更新信息参见portal.example.invalid</p>",
